#616: FILE: drivers/soc/fsl/fman/pcd/fman_kg.c:509:
+			if ((gen_params->extract > FMAN_KG_SCH_GEN_SIZE_MAX) ||
+			    (gen_params->extract == 0)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

